/Assuming you have a list of letters called ListLetters 
/with a fixed length of 7, 
/write a MARIE subroutine called DisplayLetters that reads 
/and displays all the letters from the list
/Ex,
/ListLetters = {‘M’, ‘C’, ‘D’, ‘4’, ‘7’, ‘0’ ,‘0’}
Load StartAddr
Store pointer
Jns DisplayLetters
Halt

/subroutine
DisplayLetters, hex 0
check,          LoadI pointer
                Skipcond 400    /如果等于0，跳过下一行
                Jump process
                JumpI DisplayLetters
process,        Output
                Load pointer
                Add One
                Store pointer
                Jump check
                
pointer,        hex 0
One,            hex 1
StartAddr,      ADR listLetters
listLetters,    hex 4D  /'M'
                hex 43  /'C'
                hex 44  /'D'
                hex 34  /'4'
                hex 37  /'7'
                hex 30  /'0'
                hex 30  /'0'
                hex 0   /end of string